{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And the food shall be for a store for the land</b> — He says that the food shall be a פקדון (deposit) in the hand of Pharaoh's officers, for the needs of the land during the seven years of famine, and they shall not issue from it for any other purpose, so that the land shall not be cut off by famine, just as the produce did not die in their withering."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:22:14.884554447Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}